  "_comment": "CIS Microsoft Intune for Microsoft Defender Antivirus Benchmark v1.0.0, Level 1 - Workstation: the 30 settings in the Endpoint security Antivirus profile that INT-1.5 judges. Each requirement is the benchmark's; each node and value is Microsoft's (Policy CSP - Defender, Defender CSP), because the benchmark's audit registry values are the on-device form and several are inverted relative to the CSP. Choice values are the CSP integer, the suffix Intune appends to the setting definition id; integers are the Settings Catalog integer value; threat actions are the token after the child definition id. OutOfScope accounts for every other recommendation in the benchmark, with the reason. The standard is applied only while Config/tp-standards.json IntuneAntivirusBaseline is approved. Testing/TP.IntuneAvBaseline.Tests.ps1 pins this file.",
